WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Hi there! Today we want to introduce

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
YouArt Desktop App. It can connect to your Slack,

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
to your Gmail, and to your local directories.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
It will fetch the brief and collect the assets.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.500
For AI models, you can bring your own key,

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:21.000
and the agent will pick the cheapest provider.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.000
You can generate motion graphics through Fable 5.2

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.500
or any other models,

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:33.000
and the agent can import them into After Effects

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.000
so you can edit them yourself.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Or, if you want to sit back and let the agent do

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.000
all the work, just ask it to use CapCut.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:47.000
The agent can share a review link

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:51.000
with your teammates or clients.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:54.000
They can review the storyboard and comment on the timeline.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Unlike Frame.io or Miro, there are no additional fees.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:01.500
Once the comments are in,

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:04.000
ask the agent to create the next iteration.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.000
Someone wants the scene to look like dusk.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.000
The agent uses DaVinci Resolve to adjust the color.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:14.000
And here we go!

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:16.000
Let me send it to the team on Slack.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:27.000
If you want a teammate that handles video production,

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:30.000
come and try the YouArt Desktop app.

